  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "TPKT: Don't use tvb_new_subset_length_caplen",
  "description": "If the packet length in the TPKT header, which includes the length\nof the header, is less than the fixed header length, throw an exception.\n\nUse the payload length to create the tvb subset. If we don't have\nall the payload length, and reassembly isn't available (as otherwise\nwe'd tell the TCP dissector we needed more data), instead of creating\na smaller TVB (which would throw a BoundsError), mark the packet as\nfragmented (which throws a FragmentBoundsError.)",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2025-11-21T13:59:19.353Z",
